ion:\n     ```python\n     def delete_account(username):\n         if user_exists(username):\n             remove_user(username)\n             redirect_to(\'/login\')\n     ```\n\n4. **Test-Driven Development (TDD) Approach**:\n   - Adopt a TDD approach by writing tests for new features before implementation. This will ensure that all scenarios are considered and help catch issues early in the development cycle.\n   - Pseudocode:\n     ```python\n     test_account_deletion(user):\n         login(user)\n         attempt_delete_account(user)\n         assert account_is_deleted(user)\n     ```\n\nBy addressing the issues highlighted by the unit tests and following the improvement guidance, the development process can become more structured and efficient, leading to a more robust application.')

